  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvl9u8qsvyloixf2rejcteka3@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/S712x400/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Fthumb.kakaocdn.net%2Fdna%2Fkamp%2Fsource%2Frvl9u8qsvyloixf2rejcteka3%2Fthumbs%2F2.jpg%3Fcredential%3DTuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK%26expires%3D33165462374%26signature%3DEGBCSDAnJN5dZtsSr1tWsU5sbxg%253D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvl9u8qsvyloixf2rejcteka3?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2bDl1OHFzdnlsb2l4ZjJyZWpjdGVrYTMiLCJ0aWQiOiJmMDM2NDIyNi04M2RmLTQ2MzItOTU2My03NmI3ZDg3MmI0MTIiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODY2MzJ9.Dn5uW3Neemj_vX7N-WVnoacQPwcgQ7ynusAW2kpWiN8T8gmc85HVnqTQibLK7CJIRqGIIkMNlKYOwHevL7XguA&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"712\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">우상단에 <b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">5초 타이머가 탑재된 슬라이드입니다</span></b>. <br><br>프로그램도 아니고 그냥 순열로 나타나는 ^^;; 아주아주 간단한 거 붙인 슬라이드입니다. <br><br>(클릭하면 시계가 작동하고, 실제는 5초보다 살짝 깁니다. ㅎㅎ)</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">실시간 수업시, zoom방을 나가려면</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">간단한 퀴즈에 5초만에 대답을 해야 나갈 수 있게 급조하였...습니다 ^^;;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">간단한 퀴즈<br><br>물질이름만 30개 슬라이드로 만들고<br>순물질인지 혼합물인지<br>대답하면 나가는 식으로 하려니<br>타이머가 필요해서요 ^^;;;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">시험 후 원격수업이란.....하하하<br>쉽지 않네요. ^-^</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/87f246e453f1962c4e8cd400985cfdaaeca8b685?download\" data-file-name=\"5초타이머슬라이드.show\" data-file-size=\"673944\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansoftshow\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHw%26dataid%3D394%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20201221213721&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F87f246e453f1962c4e8cd400985cfdaaeca8b685')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">5초타이머슬라이드</span><span class=\"type\">.show</span></div><div class=\"size\">658.15KB</div></div></a></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
